values (E'39000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000', E'39000000-0000-0000-0000-000000040000', E'Maddalena Stanza Canal Grande', E'62 m² / 667 sq ft', 62, 62, E'Up to 2 guests', E'King-size bed', E'Garden Terrace and Grand Canal', null, E'At 62 square metres (667 square feet), the Maddalena Stanza Canal Grande is a historic retreat overlooking the Garden Terrace and the Grand Canal. Adorned with silk wall coverings and delicate chandeliers, the expansive bedroom has a king-sized bed and a living area with tall windows, and a spacious bathroom with dressing area offering both space and privacy.', array[E'Silk wall coverings and chandeliers', E'Tall windows over the Garden Terrace and the canal', E'Chandelier in the bathroom'], null, '{}'::text[], 4)
