values (E'39000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000', E'39000000-0000-0000-0000-000000070000', E'Palazzo Chamber Luminoso', E'53 to 61 m² / 570 to 656 sq ft', 53, 61, E'Up to 2 guests', E'King-size bed', E'Historical garden or partial Grand Canal', null, E'South-facing and filled with natural light, the Palazzo Chamber Luminoso rooms offer 53 to 61 square metres (570 to 656 square feet) of space, overlooking the historical garden or with partial Grand Canal views. Several rooms keep authentic historical architectural details, and a king-sized bed and living area with writing desk, sofa or twin lounge chairs give ample space to retreat after a day out.', array[E'South-facing, filled with natural light', E'Large picture windows', E'Several rooms with historic architectural details'], null, '{}'::text[], 7)
