values (E'39000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000', E'39000000-0000-0000-0000-000000080000', E'Palazzo Chamber Affresco', E'49 to 50 m² / 527 sq ft (the site publishes both figures)', 49, 50, E'Up to 2 guests', E'King-size bed', E'Private garden', null, E'The Affresco Chambers contain historical frescoes with views over the manicured gardens below. An inviting king-sized bed and a living area with writing desk and sofa or twin lounge chairs complete the space, while a large bathroom with freestanding bathtub and twin vanities makes a serene place to reset in privacy.', array[E'Historical frescoes in the room', E'Views over the manicured garden', E'Freestanding bathtub and twin vanities'], null, '{}'::text[], 8)
