values (E'39000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000', E'39000000-0000-0000-0000-000000100000', E'Grand Canal Apartment', E'226 m² / 2,432 sq ft', 226, 226, E'Up to 6 guests', E'3 king-size bedrooms, each en suite', E'Grand Canal and the historic garden', E'Own wing of the palazzo', E'An elegant three-bedroom apartment spread over 226 square metres (2,432 square feet) in its own wing, with views across the city''s waterway. Of the interior bedrooms, the Grand Canal Suite frames it most beautifully with its large picture windows and filigreed arched window. The south-facing Palazzo Chamber Luminoso looks over the historic garden and the rooftop skyline beyond, and from the Palazzo Stanza Canal Grande the Grand Canal is also in sight. All three bedrooms have king-size beds and en-suite bathrooms.', array[E'Three bedrooms in their own wing', E'Grand Canal from the principal bedroom', E'Fireplaces'], null, '{}'::text[], 10)
